 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Wheat for «وكلوا واشربوا», growth for «والطيبات من الرزق». No jewel near «زينة الله» (the Name). 33 (the forbidden things): night sky, no motif. STAGING v4: c1 (31): three believers (men only) at home, in clean clothes: they stand in prayer from the start, the camera comes close on 31:3 (take your adornment; As-Sa'di: cover yourselves at every prayer), and they prostrate on 31:5-7 (at every place of prostration), rise on 31:8 and sit on 31:9 while a wheat plate stands for eating and drinking; on 31:12 (He does not love the excessive) the camera leaves them for the window and a two_paths plate. No excess is acted out. c2 (32): believers walk through a market of good provisions; growth plate on 32:9 (the good things of provision), sparkle on 32:15 (they are for those who believe), and on 32:23 (thus We detail the verses for a people who know) they read, with a book plate. No plate near 32:5 (the Name) or on either «قل». c3 (33: the prohibitions) stays ambient so that no sin is acted out: a seal plate on 33:3 (He has forbidden) and a geometric plate for 33:15-22 (associating others with Him)."
 },
